  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "So many of us know in this test, opening a public instance will give us perms.\n\nConcerns are as followed\n\n- some people are power heavy and will sanction anyone they see fit\n\n- this will deter people from joining public instances to explore or to make new friends\n\n- some groups have been notorious for bad moderation, thus individual members could use this to fill the void\n\n- People who don't know how to use the tools  can cause inconsistencies \n\nA lot of this seems very specific and targeted I know after gathering thoughts and opinions, but I'm putting it here as a collective. I just want to be able to see a bigger community reach to this matter hopefully.\n\n(I'm glad this is in testing atm)",
